<title>USA: CalComp names Johnson chairman.</title>
<headline>CalComp names Johnson chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalComp Technology Inc said Monday it has appointed Arthur Johnson as chairman.</p>
<p>Johnson, 50, succeeds Peter Teets who resigned from CalComp's board on August 1, in order to accept additional responsibilities in his new position as president and chief operating officer of Lockheed Martin Corp. Johnson also replaced Teets as president and chief operating officer of the Information and Services Sector of Lockheed.</p>
<p>Johnson was previously president of Lockheed Martin's Systems Integration Group.</p>
